  ],
  "explanation": "The question asks when the Cross of Liberty was established. The original sources provide conflicting dates depending on the specific entity referred to:\n\n1. **24 February 1919** (D1S1, D2S1): This refers to the establishment of the *Cross of Liberty* in Estonia by Konstantin Päts.\n2. **12 March 1920** (D3S1, D4S1): This also refers to the *Estonian Cross of Liberty*, again attributed to Konstantin Päts.\n3. **March 4, 1918** (D5S3): This refers to the *Order of the Cross of Liberty* in Finland, founded by General Mannerheim.\n\nThese are distinct entities (Estonian Cross of Liberty vs. Finnish Order of the Cross of Liberty), and the question does not specify which one is intended. Therefore, all valid referents and their corresponding dates are preserved."
}

